421 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 736 0 R
/E (The setup\(\) function runs once when the Arduino starts. It sets the push button as INPUT_PULLUP and the buzzer as OUTPUT using pinMode\(\).)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [16]
>>
endobj
422 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 737 0 R
