/Pg 23 0 R
/K [17]
>>
endobj
423 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 738 0 R
/E (If the push button is pressed \(LOW signal\), the buzzer turns ON using digitalWrite\(HIGH\). If the button is released \(HIGH\), the buzzer turns OFF using digitalWrite\(LOW\).)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [18]
>>
endobj
424 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
